Package: pura
Architecture: all
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, coreutils, findutils, gawk, util-linux
Suggests: pacman-contrib, fish
Description: safe Linux disk space recovery CLI
 pura cleans rebuildable caches, package-manager caches, old systemd journal
 entries, managed temporary files, and the current user's trash. It refuses
 raw block-device destruction and works independently of the calling shell.
